# Public exposure contract for an SFTP host.
# S4 composes provider-neutral DNS publication.
# This recipe intentionally has no HTTP, Nginx, ACME, or Certbot dependency.
#
# Parameters:
# --domain         required public DNS name
# --zone           required DNS zone
# --public-ipv4    required A-record value
# --dns-backend    DNS backend; default: godaddy
# --port           SSH/SFTP port; default: 22
